@startuml
autonumber
actor "ATCC" as Actor
participant ":System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> System: requests the details of a flight route by ID
activate System
System --> Actor: returns the route details (200 OK)
deactivate System

Actor -> System: requests all routes originating from a specific airport
activate System
System --> Actor: returns a paginated list of routes (200 OK)
deactivate System
deactivate Actor
@enduml